> > wrote:
>
>> *cpedu *- x1 requests/asks/petitions/solicits for x2 of/from x3 in 
>> manner/form x4.
>> *minde *- x1 issues commands/orders to x2 for result x3 (event/state) to 
>> happen; x3 is commanded to occur.
>>
>> Although two gismu are obviously semantically close to each other they 
